<title>USA: Dawson Science gets China license.</title>
<headline>Dawson Science gets China license.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dawson Science Corp said Friday it has secured an unlimited license from the Chinese government to operate a car rental business in Beijing.</p>
<p>The company said that the Chinese government released studies and projections that indicate it would earn about $30 million a year.</p>
<p>Dawson Science has more than 3,000 cars on order from Volkswagen-China to use in their fleet.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
